testArrowConversionSchemaRuntime;req;db;con;arrow_opts;lt;name_ptr;name_bytes;schema_ptr;err;msg;has_err;ok;r
⍝ Isolated runtime smoke for a minimally valid toArrowSchema call.
⍝ Uses one INTEGER column and one column name.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Arrow Schema Conversion API (runtime one-column)'

db←open ':memory:'
con←connect db
ok←1

arrow_opts←connectionArrowOptions con
r,←⊂'connectionArrowOptions returned handle' req arrow_opts≠0
ok∧←arrow_opts≠0

lt←api.duckdb_create_logical_type type.INTEGER
r,←⊂'create_logical_type(INTEGER) returned handle' req lt≠0
ok∧←lt≠0

name_bytes←('UTF-8'⎕UCS 'n'),0
name_ptr←api.duckdb_malloc ≢name_bytes
r,←⊂'malloc column name buffer succeeded' req name_ptr≠0
ok∧←name_ptr≠0
:If name_ptr≠0
    {}name_ptr write.u8 name_bytes
:EndIf

schema_ptr←api.duckdb_malloc 256
r,←⊂'malloc ArrowSchema buffer succeeded' req schema_ptr≠0
ok∧←schema_ptr≠0
:If schema_ptr≠0
    {}schema_ptr write.u8 256⍴0
:EndIf

:If ok
    err←toArrowSchema arrow_opts (⊂lt) (⊂name_ptr) 1 schema_ptr
    r,←⊂'toArrowSchema(one-column) call returned' req 1
    :If err=0
        r,←⊂'toArrowSchema(one-column) success via null error_data' req 1
    :Else
        has_err←api.duckdb_error_data_has_error err
        r,←⊂'toArrowSchema(one-column) has no error' req 0=has_err
        :If has_err
            msg←512 read.utf8 api.duckdb_error_data_message err
            r,←⊂'toArrowSchema(one-column) error message available' req 0<≢msg
        :EndIf
        {}api.duckdb_destroy_error_data ⊂err
    :EndIf
:Else
    r,←⊂'toArrowSchema(one-column) call skipped due setup failure' req 1
:EndIf

:If schema_ptr≠0
    {}api.duckdb_free schema_ptr
:EndIf
:If name_ptr≠0
    {}api.duckdb_free name_ptr
:EndIf
:If lt≠0
    {}api.duckdb_destroy_logical_type ⊂lt
:EndIf
:If arrow_opts≠0
    {}destroyArrowOptions arrow_opts
:EndIf
{}disconnect con
{}close db

⎕←↑r
⎕←''
⎕←'Arrow schema conversion runtime one-column complete!'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
